     1,
     "<div>Hi,</div><div>Convert the y_dl  dataframe with  the year.mon dates to a zoo object via the xts  package and then plot.</div><div>Assuming you have all the required packages, the following 3 lines of code should do it.</div><div>library(xts)<br>yy&lt;-xts(y_dl[,-3],as.Date(y_dl[,3]))<br>autoplot(yy[,2])</div><div> </div><div>Daniel</div>"
    ],
